  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to support research and innovation on food and health</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de apoyo a la investigacin e innovacin en alimentos y salud</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es contribuir al desarrollo de conocimientos cientficos y tecnolgicos orientados a la solucin de problemas y la innovacin en el rea de alimentos y salud humana. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) aumentar las capacidades de investigacin cientfica, desarrollo tecnolgico y recursos humanos especializados en el rea de alimentos y salud humana; y (ii) articular acciones de investigacin, formacin y transferencia de conocimiento y tecnologas en el rea alimentos y salud humana con instituciones del sistema nacional de ciencia, tecnologa e innovacin, y con el sector productivo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to contribute to the development of scientific and technological knowledge aimed at problem-solving and innovation in the area of food and human health. The specific objectives are: (i) to build capacity for scientific research, technology development, and specialized human resources in the area of food and human health; and (ii) to coordinate actions on research, training, and knowledge and technology transfer in the area of food and human health with institutions in the national science, technology, and innovation system and with the productive sector</narrative>
  </description>
